329
00:15:42,817 --> 00:15:44,819
<i>I should've known.</i>

330
00:15:44,902 --> 00:15:46,654
<i>I thought I was already in hell.</i>

331
00:15:46,737 --> 00:15:47,905
But it turns out

332
00:15:47,989 --> 00:15:50,408
