347
00:16:26,110 --> 00:16:29,197
<i>JAE JAE survived</i>
<i>all that stiff competition</i>

348
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:30,323
<i>to make it back.</i>

349
00:16:30,406 --> 00:16:31,616
