350
00:16:32,241 --> 00:16:33,618
-What about Jin-ho?
-Amazing.

351
00:16:33,701 --> 00:16:36,537
He already left us.

352
00:16:36,621 --> 00:16:38,748
Then who's left right now?

353
00:16:38,831 --> 00:16:43,544
When I left,
Dong-jae and Yurisa were still there.

354
00:16:43,628 --> 00:16:45,505
-What about Hyun-min?
-He was there at some point.

355
00:16:45,588 --> 00:16:47,173
-Does that mean he's gone now?
-He's gone?

356
00:16:47,256 --> 00:16:48,216
-Is he?
-Yes.

357
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:50,801
He left last night.

358
00:16:50,885 --> 00:16:51,719
-Last night?
-Yeah.

359
00:16:51,802 --> 00:16:52,845
What was the game?

360
00:16:52,929 --> 00:16:55,681
-It was a symmetry puzzle game
-Okay.

361
00:16:55,765 --> 00:16:57,558
between Dong-jae, Hyun-min, and me.

362
00:16:57,642 --> 00:16:59,393
-A symmetry puzzle?
-Yes.

363
00:16:59,477 --> 00:17:02,104
-And Hyun-min lost?
-Yes.

364
00:17:02,188 --> 00:17:03,731
-A symmetry puzzle?
-Yes.

365
00:17:03,814 --> 00:17:06,776
What sort of shapes stumped even Hyun-min?

366
00:17:06,859 --> 00:17:09,111
Did Yurisa participate
in that game as well?

367
00:17:09,195 --> 00:17:11,489
No, she came after her prison match.

368
00:17:12,698 --> 00:17:14,492
-It's an honor to return
-Well done.

369
00:17:14,575 --> 00:17:15,451
to the main match.

370
00:17:15,535 --> 00:17:17,453
-Welcome back.
-Who knew this day would come?

371
00:17:17,536 --> 00:17:18,746
Damn.

372
00:17:18,829 --> 00:17:20,581
These people are unbelievable.

373
00:17:20,665 --> 00:17:23,960
-I'm glad to see you've survived.
-Just one surprise after another.

374
00:17:24,043 --> 00:17:25,545
I've been in prison for five days.

375
00:17:25,628 --> 00:17:29,257
<i>Here is the current Piece count</i>
<i>for each player.</i>

376
00:17:30,633 --> 00:17:32,009
-What the?
-JAE JAE has ten Pieces!

377
00:17:32,093 --> 00:17:33,469
-What the?
-Holy!

378
00:17:33,553 --> 00:17:37,390
<i>Currently, JAE JAE holds the most Pieces.</i>

379
00:17:37,473 --> 00:17:39,183
-Amazing.
-Yes!

380
00:17:39,267 --> 00:17:43,271
<i>JAE JAE, you have passed God's test.</i>

381
00:17:43,354 --> 00:17:45,690
Damn, this is nuts.

382
00:17:45,773 --> 00:17:46,607
What's that?

383
00:17:46,691 --> 00:17:47,900
Do I just take it?

384
00:17:47,984 --> 00:17:50,319
<i>You may choose an additional reward.</i>

385
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:54,574
<i>The prize token, which will increase</i>
<i>the prize money by 100 million won,</i>

386
00:17:55,199 --> 00:17:58,244
<i>or ten Pieces just for yourself.</i>

387
00:17:58,327 --> 00:18:00,329
<i>Please choose one of the two.</i>

388
00:18:00,413 --> 00:18:02,331
I chose for the sake
of the greater good once,

389
00:18:02,415 --> 00:18:04,667
so I'll choose ten Pieces this time.

390
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:08,004
<i>Please take your reward</i>
<i>and return to the game area.</i>

391
00:18:09,422 --> 00:18:10,673
What's going on right now?

392
00:18:10,756 --> 00:18:12,216
There's always a silver lining!

393
00:18:12,300 --> 00:18:13,634
Congrats.

394
00:18:13,718 --> 00:18:15,094
Seriously?

395
00:18:15,177 --> 00:18:18,806
<i>Now, let me introduce</i>
<i>the fifth main match.</i>

396
00:18:18,889 --> 00:18:19,807
Sure.

397
00:18:19,890 --> 00:18:21,309
<i>Today's main match is</i>

398
00:18:21,809 --> 00:18:23,227
<i>Hidden Word.</i>

399
00:18:24,270 --> 00:18:27,440
<i>In Hidden Word, players must use</i>
<i>the concept of association</i>

400
00:18:27,523 --> 00:18:32,820
<i>to hide their words</i>
<i>while figuring out their opponent's.</i>

401
00:18:32,903 --> 00:18:35,406
<i>The game will run</i>
<i>for a total of two rounds,</i>

402
00:18:35,489 --> 00:18:39,702
<i>and in each round,</i>
<i>players will take turns as the prompter,</i>

403
00:18:39,785 --> 00:18:42,580
<i>with the order decided</i>
<i>by drawing lottery balls.</i>

404
00:18:43,831 --> 00:18:44,832
<i>Before Round 1 begins,</i>

405
00:18:45,416 --> 00:18:47,209
<i>players will enter the dealer room</i>

406
00:18:47,293 --> 00:18:50,421
<i>and select one envelope out of six,</i>

407
00:18:50,504 --> 00:18:52,173
<i>each containing five common nouns.</i>

408
00:18:52,798 --> 00:18:54,634
<i>After checking the five words,</i>

409
00:18:54,717 --> 00:18:59,096
<i>players must select one</i>
<i>to be their hidden word for Round 1.</i>

410
00:19:00,097 --> 00:19:03,476
<i>Once all players have decided</i>
<i>on their hidden word for Round 1,</i>

411
00:19:03,559 --> 00:19:05,603
<i>starting with the first player,</i>

412
00:19:05,686 --> 00:19:07,980
<i>players will take turns as the prompter</i>
<i>to offer a hint</i>

413
00:19:08,064 --> 00:19:09,523
<i>related to their hidden word.</i>

414
00:19:10,107 --> 00:19:14,320
<i>Only nouns in Korean</i>
<i>may be given as hints.</i>

415
00:19:14,403 --> 00:19:15,738
-Nouns?
-Nouns.

416
00:19:15,821 --> 00:19:18,282
<i>Once the prompter offers a hint word,</i>

417
00:19:18,366 --> 00:19:21,160
<i>the association score</i>
<i>with the hidden word will be revealed.</i>

418
00:19:21,243 --> 00:19:23,120
-What?
<i>-Please note</i>

419
00:19:23,204 --> 00:19:25,206
-Who decides that?
<i>-that the association score</i>

420
00:19:25,289 --> 00:19:28,209
<i>is calculated using an AI system.</i>

421
00:19:28,292 --> 00:19:29,919
-An AI system?
-AI.

422
00:19:30,002 --> 00:19:35,132
<i>The AI model used is a language model</i>
<i>trained on an extensive text dataset.</i>

423
00:19:35,216 --> 00:19:38,094
<i>It analyzes the input words</i>
<i>using the following method</i>

424
00:19:38,177 --> 00:19:40,680
<i>-to derive an association score.</i>
-This is gonna be fun.

425
00:19:40,763 --> 00:19:41,847
<i>Semantic distance.</i>

426
00:19:41,931 --> 00:19:43,391
<i>This looks at how closely</i>

427
00:19:43,474 --> 00:19:46,769
<i>the words' dictionary definitions</i>
<i>and underlying concepts overlap.</i>

428
00:19:48,396 --> 00:19:49,855
<i>Contextual co-occurrence.</i>

429
00:19:49,939 --> 00:19:52,900
<i>This looks at how often the two words</i>

430
00:19:52,983 --> 00:19:56,570
<i>tend to show up together</i>
<i>in the same sentence or similar context.</i>

431
00:19:56,654 --> 00:19:58,114
<i>Relational structure.</i>

432
00:19:58,197 --> 00:20:02,076
<i>This looks at how the words are connected</i>
<i>to each other and infers association</i>

433
00:20:02,159 --> 00:20:03,744
<i>based on that relationship.</i>

434
00:20:04,370 --> 00:20:06,038
<i>By combining these three factors,</i>

435
00:20:06,122 --> 00:20:09,375
<i>the AI calculates</i>
<i>a numerical association score.</i>

436
00:20:09,959 --> 00:20:13,295
<i>The association score</i>
<i>is not a fixed value.</i>

437
00:20:13,379 --> 00:20:17,508
<i>It is calculated based on language data</i>
<i>that is continuously updated.</i>

438
00:20:18,342 --> 00:20:20,761
<i>The prompter may offer</i>

439
00:20:20,845 --> 00:20:24,432
<i>up to 10 hint words</i>
<i>within a 15-minute time limit.</i>

440
00:20:24,932 --> 00:20:29,478
<i>If the association score of a given word</i>
<i>reaches 95% or higher,</i>

441
00:20:29,562 --> 00:20:32,481
<i>the hint stage will end immediately.</i>

442
00:20:34,525 --> 00:20:37,820
<i>If the prompter fails to present a word</i>
<i>with an association score of 95% or higher</i>

443
00:20:37,903 --> 00:20:39,238
<i>within ten tries,</i>

444
00:20:39,321 --> 00:20:42,032
<i>the word with the highest association</i>
<i>to the hidden word</i>

445
00:20:42,116 --> 00:20:43,409
<i>will be automatically revealed,</i>

446
00:20:43,492 --> 00:20:45,870
-Damn.
<i>-and the hint stage will end.</i>

447
00:20:45,953 --> 00:20:47,121
Seriously?

448
00:20:47,204 --> 00:20:49,331
<i>The other players</i>
<i>will then be given a chance</i>

449
00:20:49,415 --> 00:20:52,501
<i>to guess the prompter's hidden word.</i>

450
00:20:53,878 --> 00:20:55,880
<i>All players will have five minutes</i>

451
00:20:55,963 --> 00:20:58,340
<i>to write down the word</i>
<i>they believe is the correct answer,</i>

452
00:20:58,424 --> 00:21:00,134
<i>after which they will reveal</i>
<i>at the same time.</i>

453
00:21:00,217 --> 00:21:04,764
<i>Players may pay one Piece</i>
<i>to present one additional answer,</i>

454
00:21:04,847 --> 00:21:09,185
<i>and only one Piece can be used</i>
<i>per hidden word.</i>

455
00:21:09,727 --> 00:21:11,854
-I'll be using all ten.
-You could place first.

456
00:21:11,937 --> 00:21:15,608
<i>Those who correctly guess the hidden word</i>
<i>will earn one point.</i>

457
00:21:16,233 --> 00:21:18,903
<i>If no one guesses</i>
<i>the hidden word correctly,</i>

458
00:21:18,986 --> 00:21:21,947
<i>the prompter will earn one point</i>

459
00:21:22,031 --> 00:21:24,116
<i>and begin the second stage of hints.</i>

460
00:21:24,867 --> 00:21:27,870
<i>Hints can be given up to three stages,</i>

461
00:21:27,953 --> 00:21:32,750
<i>and the prompter will earn points</i>
<i>whenever the other players</i>

462
00:21:32,833 --> 00:21:34,418
<i>fail to guess their hidden word.</i>

463
00:21:35,711 --> 00:21:39,215
<i>If no one guesses correctly in Round 1,</i>
<i>the prompter will earn</i>

464
00:21:39,298 --> 00:21:40,841
<i>one point in the first stage,</i>

465
00:21:40,925 --> 00:21:43,302
<i>two in the second stage,</i>

466
00:21:43,385 --> 00:21:46,180
<i>and three in the third stage.</i>

467
00:21:46,263 --> 00:21:50,267
<i>In Round 2,</i>
<i>all point values will be doubled.</i>

468
00:21:50,351 --> 00:21:51,393
Doubled in the second round?

469
00:21:52,102 --> 00:21:54,980
<i>Once a player correctly guesses</i>
<i>the hidden word,</i>

470
00:21:55,064 --> 00:21:57,733
<i>the current prompter's turn will end,</i>

471
00:21:57,817 --> 00:22:00,528
<i>and the next player in order</i>
<i>will become the prompter.</i>

472
00:22:01,153 --> 00:22:03,948
<i>Once every player</i>
<i>has had a turn as the prompter,</i>

473
00:22:04,031 --> 00:22:05,491
<i>Round 1 will end.</i>

474
00:22:05,574 --> 00:22:06,784
<i>Before Round 2 begins,</i>

475
00:22:06,867 --> 00:22:11,205
<i>players will choose one of the four words</i>
<i>remaining in their envelopes</i>

476
00:22:11,288 --> 00:22:13,541
<i>to use as their hidden word for Round 2.</i>

477
00:22:14,333 --> 00:22:16,544
<i>Once Round 2 is complete,</i>

478
00:22:16,627 --> 00:22:20,130
<i>final rankings will be determined</i>
<i>in order of total points earned.</i>

479
00:22:20,756 --> 00:22:21,841
<i>Based on the results,</i>

480
